@page 82 litany
c __The LITANY.__
P That it may please thee to strengthen such
  as do stand, and to comfort and help the weak-
  hearted, and to raise up them that fall, and fi-
  nally to beat down Satan under our feet;
T __We beseech thee to hear us, good Lord.__
P That it may please thee to succour, help,
  and comfort all that are in danger, necessity,
  and tribulation;
T __We beseech thee to hear us, good Lord.__
P That it may please thee to preserve all that
  travel by land or by water, all women labour-
  ing of child, all sick persons and young chil-
  dren, and to shew thy pity upon all prisoners
  and captives;
T __We beseech thee to hear us, good Lord.__
P That it may please thee to defend and pro-
  vide for the fatherless children and widows,
  and all that are desolate and oppressed;
T __We beseech thee to hear us, good Lord.__
P That it may please thee to have mercy up-
  on all men;
T __We beseech thee to hear us, good Lord.__
P That it may please thee to forgive our ene-
  mies, persecutors and slanderers, and to turn
  their hearts;
T __We beseech thee to hear us, good Lord.__
P That it may please thee to give and preserve
  to our use the kindly fruits of the earth, so as
  in due time we may enjoy them;
T __We beseech thee to hear us, good Lord.__
